---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro"
import Text from "@/components/typography/Text.astro"
import Separator from "@/components/ui/Separator.astro"
import miniGole from "@/assets/bio/mini-gole.png"
import collegeDays from "@/assets/images/college-days.png"
---

<PageLayout heading="Bio" description="A personal journal by Manish Tamang (golecodes).">
  <section class="grid items-start gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-muted-foreground uppercase">Journal</p>
      <Text>
        Since childhood, I have been driven by curiosity and a deep passion for learning. I have always been eager to
        explore new ideas and understand how things work, often looking at them from different perspectives.
      </Text>
      <Text>
        I am naturally drawn to minimalism and clarity, preferring simplicity over anything cluttered or messy. From
        the very beginning, I have carried a positive mindset toward growth, always seeking to learn, improve, and see
        the bigger picture.
      </Text>
    </div>

    <!-- Name card: the caption slides up on hover -->
    <figure class="group relative h-48 w-40 overflow-hidden rounded-lg justify-self-center sm:justify-self-end">
      <Image src={miniGole} alt="Manish Tamang as a kid" width={160} densities={[1, 2]} draggable="false" class="size-full object-cover opacity-90 select-none" />
      <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 -bottom-16 flex flex-col gap-1 bg-subtle p-2 transition-[bottom] duration-500 group-hover:bottom-0">
        <span class="font-display text-lg text-link">Manish Gole</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">My friends also call me Gole.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <Separator class="my-10" />
  <section class="grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <figure>
      <Image
        src={collegeDays}
        alt="Two yellow school buses parked side by side at dusk, with students looking out of the windows"
        widths={[320, 480, 720]}
        sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 360px"
        quality={78}
        class="aspect-square w-full rounded-lg border border-border object-cover grayscale"
      />
      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Best days of my life, college days.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <Text>
        I did my +2 in Science at Sushma Godawari College, majoring in Computer Science. Those two years are the ones I
        keep going back to: the bus rides, the bench mates, and the friends who made even the long days easy.
      </Text>
      <Text>
        It was also when I got serious about building things. I went to college during the day, then worked as a MERN
        stack intern in the evenings, and I still can't believe how much fit into that time.
      </Text>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="journal" class="mt-12">
    <Text tone="muted" size="sm">Journal entries coming soon.</Text>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
